KC builder (k27 tree scripts/kc_native.py): relocation-free constant sections of a native kext in its __TEXT
(KC_NATIVE_CONST_TO_TEXT=1)

UniXNU-piano patches/k27-kc/0002, applied to the local k27 tree by hand (patches/k27-kc/README.md); docs/kc-space.md has the
measurements. Off by default (byte for byte the same output). KC_NATIVE_CONST_TO_TEXT=1: an object's __DATA,__const or
__DATA_CONST,__const section without relocations (an .incbin firmware image, a table of numbers) goes to the kext's __TEXT,__const
instead of its __DATA_CONST,__const: it needs no chained fixup and stays read only.

Measured (main's 21 kexts): the natives' __DATA_CONST 833.7 -> 111.6 KiB (PianoTouch's two panel images and PianoA830's four GPU
images move to __TEXT), the collection's free __DATA_CONST 3190.5 -> 3912.6 KiB, its free __TEXT 4723.5 -> 4002.8 KiB.

